  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Development Forum 2019</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Utvecklingsforum 2019</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Sida&apos;s annual event bringing together players in development cooperation in Sweden. The purpose is to exchange experiences be inspired by each other, thereby creating a strengthened partnership and increased commitment. Development forum is arranged within the framwork of the 2030 Agenda, this year focus is on gender equality.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Sidas &#xe5;rliga event som samlar akt&#xf6;rer inom utvecklingssamarbetet i Sverige. Syftet &#xe4;r att utbyta erfarenheter och inspireras av varandra och d&#xe4;rigenom skapa ett st&#xe4;rkt partnerskap och &#xf6;kat engagamang. Utvecklingsforum genomf&#xf6;rs alltid inom ramen f&#xf6;r Agenda 2030, detta &#xe5;r &#xe4;r temat j&#xe4;mst&#xe4;lldhet.</narrative>
  </description>
